    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85880" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποσάκις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ</span>], Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>how many times? how often?</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				353d
			</span></i>; poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποσσάκι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				119
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Indef.,
				<i>so many times,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ π. ποσοὶ [ἀριθμοί],</span> i.e.
				<i>square</i> numbers, and 
